>what is ChrHack???

ChrHack (available at wuarchive.wustl.edu:/pub/MSDOS_UPLOADS/games/chrhac23.arj)
is a utility which transforms the normal text style graphics into bitmaps.

It does this without being staying resident (TSR) or altering the nethack
executable.

Requires: Nethack 3.1
          EGA/VGA

A bitmap editor is also included.


